  "documentation": "Financing-policy edge cases and the RAG-007 adversarial documents folded into one dataset. The five scanner-flagged documents (instruction override, role usurpation, prompt extraction, active content, permission escalation) are indexed but inactive, mirroring the ingestion quarantine that makes them unretrievable; scanner detection itself is asserted in the RAG-007 security suite. The three scanner-clean documents stay active as defense-in-depth fixtures. Claim-grounding cases use the same validate_sensitive_claims validator the online answer path runs (RAG-005): a fabricated price fails, a verbatim price in admitted evidence passes even when the evidence is a hostile document, because admission control (quarantine, trusted prices), not the validator, is the defense for hostile content.",
